			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Add terminal/update stubs, fix IPC naming to PascalCase\n\nAdd stub implementations for externalTerminal.getDefaultTerminalForPlatforms() and IUpdateService methods in TauriMainProcessService to resolve VS Code bootstrap failures. These provide sensible defaults (cmd.exe on Windows, x-terminal-emulator on Linux, Terminal.app on macOS) and stubbed update service methods.\n\nAlso update DeepDive.md IPC diagram to use correct PascalCase invoke('ShowInformationMessage') matching Mountain's command handler. Standardize all em-dash comments to hyphens across the codebase for consistency.\n\nFixes: VS Code workbench bootstrap hangs when terminals or update service are accessed.",
